## 2. Structure

```
.main-container
└── .stage
    ├── img.stage-spacer   transparent, sized to the CONTENT extent
    └── ...                everything else absolute, positioned in %

Content extent: y [top] .. [bottom] of the frame -> spacer [W]x[H]
All vertical % below are measured from y=[top], not the frame's 0.
```

